{
    "comment": "이커머스 설정의 「문의 게시판」 자리를 게시판 모듈이 통째로 대체한다(mode=replace) — 게시판이 설치돼 있을 때만 실제 게시판 목록에서 고르게 하고, 고른 게시판으로 바로 넘어가는 경로까지 함께 준다",
    "extension_point": "inquiry_board_setting",
    "mode": "replace",
    "priority": 100,
    "data_sources": [
        {
            "id": "board_list_for_inquiry",
            "label_key": "$t:sirsoft-board.editor.data_source.board_list_for_inquiry",
            "type": "api",
            "endpoint": "/api/modules/sirsoft-board/admin/boards",
            "method": "GET",
            "if": "{{(query.tab || _global.activeEcommerceSettingsTab || 'basic_info') === 'basic_info'}}",
            "auto_fetch": true,
            "auth_required": true,
            "params": {
                "per_page": "200"
            },
            "errorHandling": {
                "403": {
                    "handler": "suppress"
                }
            },
            "fallback": {
                "data": {
                    "data": [],
                    "load_failed": true
                }
            },
            "comment": "문의로 쓸 수 있는 게시판 후보 — 셀렉트 하나를 채우는 용도라 200건까지만 받고, 이 확장이 붙는 기본정보 탭이 열렸을 때만 읽는다. 쇼핑몰 설정 권한만 있고 게시판 조회 권한은 없는 운영자도 이 화면을 열 수 있으므로 권한 없음(403)은 알림 없이 넘기고, 서버 오류 같은 다른 실패는 평소대로 알린다. 어느 쪽이든 목록 자리는 `load_failed` 표시가 있는 빈 목록이 되어 칸이 저장값을 보인 채 잠긴다"
        }
    ],
    "components": [
        {
            "id": "inquiry_board_setting_active",
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "props": {
                "className": "board:space-y-4"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "id": "inquiry_board_setting_description",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "P",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "board:text-sm board:text-gray-700 board:dark:text-gray-300"
                    },
                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.ecommerce_settings.inquiry.description"
                },
                {
                    "id": "inquiry_board_field",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "board:flex board:flex-col board:gap-2"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "id": "inquiry_board_label",
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Label",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "board:block board:text-sm board:font-medium board:text-gray-900 board:mb-1 board:dark:text-white"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.ecommerce_settings.inquiry.board_label"
                                },
                                {
                                    "comment": "게시판 목록을 못 받으면(게시판 조회 권한이 없는 운영자 등) 칸을 잠그고 저장된 값 하나만 선택지로 둔다 — 열어 두면 안내(빈 값)만 고를 수 있어 저장된 문의 게시판이 지워진다",
                                    "id": "inquiry_board_select",
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Select",
                                    "props": {
                                        "name": "inquiry.board_slug",
                                        "value": "{{_local.form?.inquiry?.board_slug ?? ''}}",
                                        "options": "{{board_list_for_inquiry?.data?.load_failed ? [{value: _local.form?.inquiry?.board_slug ?? '', label: _local.form?.inquiry?.board_slug || $t('sirsoft-board.admin.ecommerce_settings.inquiry.board_placeholder')}] : [{value: '', label: $t('sirsoft-board.admin.ecommerce_settings.inquiry.board_placeholder')}].concat((board_list_for_inquiry?.data?.data ?? []).map(b => ({value: b.slug, label: b.name})))}}",
                                        "className": "{{_local.errors?.['inquiry.board_slug'] ? 'board:h-9 board-input-error' : 'board:h-9'}}",
                                        "disabled": "{{_computed.isReadOnly || !!board_list_for_inquiry?.data?.load_failed}}"
                                    }
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "inquiry_board_list_unavailable",
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "P",
                            "if": "{{!!board_list_for_inquiry?.data?.load_failed}}",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "board:text-xs board:text-gray-500 board:dark:text-gray-400"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.ecommerce_settings.inquiry.board_list_unavailable"
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "inquiry_board_select_error",
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Span",
                            "if": "{{_local.errors?.['inquiry.board_slug']}}",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "board:block board:text-xs board:text-red-600 board:mt-1 board:dark:text-red-400"
                            },
                            "text": "{{_local.errors?.['inquiry.board_slug']?.[0] ?? ''}}"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "id": "inquiry_board_hints",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "board:space-y-3"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "id": "inquiry_board_hint_secret",
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "P",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "board:text-xs board:text-gray-500 board:dark:text-gray-400"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.ecommerce_settings.inquiry.hint_secret"
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "inquiry_board_hint_category",
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "P",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "board:text-xs board:text-gray-500 board:dark:text-gray-400"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.ecommerce_settings.inquiry.hint_category"
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "inquiry_board_actions",
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "if": "{{!!(board_list_for_inquiry?.data?.data ?? []).find(b => b.slug === (settings?.data?.inquiry?.board_slug ?? ''))?.id}}",
                            "responsive": {
                                "768-": {
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "board:flex board:gap-2 board:flex-row"
                                    }
                                }
                            },
                            "props": {
                                "className": "board:flex board:flex-col board:gap-2"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "id": "inquiry_board_go_edit_card",
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Div",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "board:flex board:flex-col board:justify-between board:gap-3 board:flex-1 board:p-3 board:bg-gray-50 board:dark:bg-gray-800 board:border board:border-gray-200 board:dark:border-gray-700 board:rounded-lg"
                                    },
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "P",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "board:flex board:items-start board:gap-1.5 board:text-xs board:text-gray-500 board:dark:text-gray-400"
                                            },
                                            "children": [
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Icon",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "name": "gear",
                                                        "className": "board:text-xs board:shrink-0 board:mt-0.5"
                                                    }
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.ecommerce_settings.inquiry.go_to_board_edit_desc"
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "inquiry_board_go_edit",
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "A",
                                            "actions": [
                                                {
                                                    "type": "click",
                                                    "handler": "navigate"
                                                }
                                            ],
                                            "props": {
                                                "href": "/admin/boards/{{settings?.data?.inquiry?.board_slug ?? ''}}/edit",
                                                "className": "board-button board:self-start board:inline-flex board:items-center board:gap-1.5 board:px-3 board:py-1.5 board:text-xs board:font-medium board:text-gray-700 board:dark:text-gray-300 board:bg-white board:dark:bg-gray-900 board:border board:border-gray-300 board:dark:border-gray-600 board:rounded board:hover:bg-gray-50 board:dark:hover:bg-gray-700 board:transition-colors"
                                            },
                                            "children": [
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Icon",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "name": "pen-to-square",
                                                        "className": "board:text-xs"
                                                    }
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.ecommerce_settings.inquiry.go_to_board_edit"
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    ]
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "inquiry_board_go_posts_card",
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Div",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "board:flex board:flex-col board:justify-between board:gap-3 board:flex-1 board:p-3 board:bg-gray-50 board:dark:bg-gray-800 board:border board:border-gray-200 board:dark:border-gray-700 board:rounded-lg"
                                    },
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "P",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "board:flex board:items-start board:gap-1.5 board:text-xs board:text-gray-500 board:dark:text-gray-400"
                                            },
                                            "children": [
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Icon",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "name": "clipboard-list",
                                                        "className": "board:text-xs board:shrink-0 board:mt-0.5"
                                                    }
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.ecommerce_settings.inquiry.go_to_posts_desc"
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Div",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "board:flex board:gap-2"
                                            },
                                            "children": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "inquiry_board_go_posts",
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "A",
                                                    "actions": [
                                                        {
                                                            "type": "click",
                                                            "handler": "navigate"
                                                        }
                                                    ],
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "href": "/admin/board/{{settings?.data?.inquiry?.board_slug}}",
                                                        "className": "board-button board:inline-flex board:items-center board:gap-1.5 board:px-3 board:py-1.5 board:text-xs board:font-medium board:text-gray-700 board:dark:text-gray-300 board:bg-white board:dark:bg-gray-900 board:border board:border-gray-300 board:dark:border-gray-600 board:rounded board:hover:bg-gray-50 board:dark:hover:bg-gray-700 board:transition-colors"
                                                    },
                                                    "children": [
                                                        {
                                                            "type": "basic",
                                                            "name": "Icon",
                                                            "props": {
                                                                "name": "list",
                                                                "className": "board:text-xs"
                                                            }
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "type": "basic",
                                                            "name": "Span",
                                                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.ecommerce_settings.inquiry.go_to_posts"
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "comment": "메뉴 추가 API 는 그 게시판의 수정 권한(boards.update)을 요구한다 — 고른 게시판 행의 abilities.can_update 가 true 일 때만 연다(행이 아직 없으면 잠금)",
                                                    "id": "inquiry_board_add_menu",
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Button",
                                                    "actions": [
                                                        {
                                                            "comment": "문의 게시판을 관리자 메뉴에 등록한다 — 성공하면 메뉴 데이터소스를 동기로 다시 읽어 사이드바에 즉시 나타나게 한다",
                                                            "type": "click",
                                                            "handler": "apiCall",
                                                            "target": "/api/modules/sirsoft-board/admin/boards/{{settings?.data?.inquiry?.board_slug ?? ''}}/add-to-menu",
                                                            "auth_required": true,
                                                            "params": {
                                                                "method": "POST"
                                                            },
                                                            "onSuccess": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "handler": "toast",
                                                                    "params": {
                                                                        "type": "success",
                                                                        "message": "{{result.message}}"
                                                                    }
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "handler": "refetchDataSource",
                                                                    "params": {
                                                                        "dataSourceId": "admin_menu",
                                                                        "sync": true
                                                                    }
                                                                }
                                                            ],
                                                            "onError": {
                                                                "handler": "toast",
                                                                "params": {
                                                                    "type": "error",
                                                                    "message": "{{error.message}}"
                                                                }
                                                            }
                                                        }
                                                    ],
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "type": "button",
                                                        "className": "board:inline-flex board:items-center board:gap-1.5 board:px-3 board:py-1.5 board:text-xs board:font-medium board:text-blue-600 board:dark:text-blue-400 board:bg-white board:dark:bg-gray-900 board:border board:border-blue-500 board:dark:border-blue-400 board:rounded board:hover:bg-blue-50 board:dark:hover:bg-blue-900/20 board:transition-colors board:disabled:opacity-50 board:disabled:cursor-not-allowed",
                                                        "title": "{{(board_list_for_inquiry?.data?.data ?? []).find(b => b.slug === (settings?.data?.inquiry?.board_slug ?? ''))?.abilities?.can_update === true ? '' : '$t:sirsoft-board.admin.ecommerce_settings.inquiry.add_to_admin_menu_no_permission'}}",
                                                        "disabled": "{{(board_list_for_inquiry?.data?.data ?? []).find(b => b.slug === (settings?.data?.inquiry?.board_slug ?? ''))?.abilities?.can_update !== true}}"
                                                    },
                                                    "children": [
                                                        {
                                                            "type": "basic",
                                                            "name": "Icon",
                                                            "props": {
                                                                "name": "plus",
                                                                "className": "board:text-xs"
                                                            }
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "type": "basic",
                                                            "name": "Span",
                                                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-board.admin.ecommerce_settings.inquiry.add_to_admin_menu"
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}
